@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
state "待确认差异" as Draft
state "待重新核对" as Refresh
state "差异已确认" as Approved
state "不予调整" as Rejected
[*] --> Draft : 保留实点快照\n[有批次位置与盘点时点]\n/ 暂不改变库存
Draft --> Refresh : 核对确认依据\n[快照后有新变动]\n/ 要求重核差异
Refresh --> Draft : 重新确认实点\n[新快照及原因完整]\n/ 保留原核实经历
Draft --> Approved : 核对确认依据\n[负责人同意且依据一致]\n/ 形成唯一差异变动
Draft --> Rejected : 拒绝差异调整\n[负责人说明原因]\n/ 库存不变

@enduml
